2	line	Marlo	Dad lives in the south-east of Varrock, west of Aubury's Rune Shop. His name's Yarlo. Old Man Yarlo, they call him. He's sure to be at home, so keep looking around.
2	action	end
1	option	What's my current construction contract?
0	section	Talking to Old Man Yarlo
1	line	Old Man Yarlo	What brings you here, young man?
1	line	Player	Marlo sent me to fix your furniture.
1	line	Old Man Yarlo	My boy Marlo sent you? Oh yes, you've come to help with my furniture. It's in a terrible state. You'll want to start by removing all the tatty old furniture.
1	line	Old Man Yarlo	There are two stools, two tables, a chair and a rotten carpet to replace. I need a better bed too. Let me know when you've removed all the old furniture.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Old Man Yarlo again if none of the old furniture was removed
1	line	Old Man Yarlo	Ah, young man, how's the redecoration coming on?
1	line	Player	What am I supposed to be doing again?
1	line	Old Man Yarlo	You'll want to start by removing all the tatty old furniture. There are two stools, two tables, a chair and a rotten carpet to remove, as well as the campbed. Let me know when you've done that.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Old Man Yarlo again if some of the old furniture was removed
